          "name": "Schedule Pickup",
          "text": "Arrange a convenient logistics window for your Bakersfield facility, accommodating dock requirements, security protocols, and operational hours.",
          "image": "https://www.stselectronicrecyclinginc.com/images/2017/compressed/mac-2585220_1920.jpg"
        },
